  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just Because**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Tequila Sunrise (Eagles cover)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Weeks Go By Like Days**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Hot Legs (Rod Stewart cover)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Lowdown, Tyrone (Erykah Badu cover), Phone Went West [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2000-04-15.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 106 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Initially the first known audience recording, until the January 2000 Antwerp show appeared [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2000-04-15.aud.flac16**: taped by Steven V.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD or DAT > CD-R [1]. Also: CD-R transferred to FLAC using EAC and CoolEditPro, part of Archive Volume 8 [1]",
